        "title": "Prosthesis vs. Biological Hand & Arm",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Did you think about how the servo is similar to a part of a biological hand or arm? If not, go back to your sketch and add it.</p><p>While you are working on that, think about any other changes you want to make.</p><p></p><p><strong>Make your changes in a different color or write that they are new.</strong> That way, you can see how your thinking changes over time!</p>"
